  "prefLabel": "Bal 104.03 Copies of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bal 104.03 Copies of Records. Persons desiring copies of commission records shall submit a request in writing which identifies as particularly as possible the information being sought and agrees to pay a copying fee of $.25 per page. If records are requested which contain both public and confidential information, the commission shall delete the confidential information and provide the remaining information.\n\nSource. #6262, eff 6-7-96",
